==Trivia==
*This card's standard illustration depicts a male {{p|Hippopotas}}, while the illustration rare print shows both male and female Hippopotas.
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BREAKthrough|Hippopotas|83}} from the {{TCG|BREAKthrough}} expansion.
*'''Rolling Tackle''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Team Rocket|Dark Electrode|34}} from {{TCG|Team Rocket}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

